# ==============================================================================
# NOTES
# ==============================================================================
#
# COMMON EVENT KINDS:
#   0     - Profile metadata
#   1     - Short note
#   6     - Repost
#   7     - Reaction
#   9735  - Zap receipt
#   9802  - Highlight
#   30023 - Long-form article
#   30040 - Publication container
#   30041 - Section
#   30818 - Wiki page
#   5000+ - DVM job requests
#   6000+ - DVM job results
#
# RELATION TYPES:
#   "author"              - Event's author (pubkey)
#   "e_tag"               - Referenced event (e-tag)
#   "a_tag"               - Addressable event reference (a-tag)
#   "p_tag"               - Mentioned profile (p-tag)
#   "sender"              - Custom: zap sender
#   "recipient"           - Custom: zap recipient
#   "highlighted_author"  - Custom: author of highlighted content
#
# FETCH MODES:
#   "single"    - Fetch one related event
#   "tree"      - Build hierarchical tree
#   "aggregate" - Compute statistics
#   "expanded"  - Fetch and inline content
#
# RELAY MODES:
#   "general" - Use user.relays
#   "custom"  - Use feed-specific relays
#   "inbox"   - Use user's inbox relays (NIP-65)
#
# FETCH STRATEGIES:
#   "stream"  - Continuous polling for new events
#   "manual"  - Fetch only on explicit request
#   "polling" - Periodic refresh
#
# ==============================================================================
